1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Gentle reality check:

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,500
The person you met once
is not your friend yet.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,500
One great conversation is
a doorway, not a relationship.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Don't over-invest:
no essays, no intensity.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Don't under-invest either:
silence closes the door.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:22,500
The move is light + repeated: low-pressure message, shared setting,
see them again.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,000
Keep it casual.
Let the reps do the work.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Start with one social rep. Link in bio.
